cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Bond-network nuclear structure model (v5.0 frozen rules): code, data and one-command reproduction"
message: >-
  Code and data for the four-bond saturated bond-network model of nuclear
  structure: diamond-limit nuclear matter, emergent liquid-drop coefficients,
  geometric observables validation (H to Ca), decay-mode decision layer and
  the differential Q-value formula family (F1-F4).
authors:
